"      -D ENABLE_SPEECH_SYNTHESIS=OFF   \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja ..            &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>rm -rf * .[^.]* &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"cmake -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release      \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr     \\\n"
"      -D CMAKE_SKIP_INSTALL_RPATH=ON   \\\n"
"      -D PORT=GTK                      \\\n"
"      -D LIB_INSTALL_DIR=/usr/lib      \\\n"
"      -D USE_LIBBACKTRACE=OFF          \\\n"
"      -D USE_LIBHYPHEN=OFF             \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_GAMEPAD=OFF            \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_MINIBROWSER=ON         \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF      \\\n"
"      -D USE_WOFF2=OFF                 \\\n"
"      -D USE_GTK4=ON                   \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_JOURNALD_LOG=OFF       \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_BUBBLEWRAP_SANDBOX=ON  \\\n"
"      -D USE_SYSPROF_CAPTURE=NO        \\\n"
"      -D ENABLE_SPEECH_SYNTHESIS=OFF   \\\n"
"      -W no-dev -G Ninja ..            &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:301
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the <option>-D ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF</option> option is used, the "
"documentation is not rebuilt nor installed now.  If you need the "
"documentation, you can either install <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> and remove"
" this option from the <command>cmake</command> command, or install the pre-"
"built documentation (only for the GTK-4 version)  instead:"
msgstr ""
"Como a opção <option>-D ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF</option> é usada, a "
"documentação não é reconstruída nem instalada agora. Se precisar da "
"documentação, você pode, ou instalar o <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> e remover"
" essa opção do comando <command>cmake</command>, ou instalar a documentação "
"pré construída (somente para a versão GTK-4):"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:309
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /usr/share/gtk-doc/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv ../Documentation/* /usr/share/gtk-doc/html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -vdm755 /usr/share/gtk-doc/html &amp;&amp;\n"
"cp -rv ../Documentation/* /usr/share/gtk-doc/html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:315
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:321
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D USE_LIBBACKTRACE=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables the use"
" of libbacktrace for dumping a stack trace when a crash happens.  You need "
"to install &libbacktrace; if you wish to enable it (replacing OFF with ON or"
" just removing the switch)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D USE_LIBBACKTRACE=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita o uso "
"de libbacktrace para despejar um rastreamento de pilha quando uma falha "
"acontece. Você precisa instalar o &libbacktrace; se desejar habilitá-la "
"(substituindo OFF por ON ou apenas removendo a chave)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:328
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D USE_LIBHYPHEN=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables the "
"default automatic hyphenation implementation. You need to install <ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/hunspell/files/Hyphen/\">Hyphen</ulink>"
" if you wish to enable it (replacing OFF with ON or just removing the "
"switch)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D USE_LIBHYPHEN=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a "
"implementação padrão de hifenização automática. Você precisa instalar o "
"<ulink "
"url=\"https://sourceforge.net/projects/hunspell/files/Hyphen/\">Hyphen</ulink>"
" se desejar habilitá-la (substituindo OFF por ON ou apenas removendo a "
"chave)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:337
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables "
"regenerating the documentation. Remove this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> installed and wish to regenerate the documentation."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_DOCUMENTATION=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita a "
"regeneração da documentação. Remova essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> instalado e desejar gerar novamente a documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:344
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_GAMEPAD=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables gamepad "
"support. Remove this switch if you have <ulink "
"url=\"https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/libmanette/\">libmanette</ulink> "
"installed and wish to enable it."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_GAMEPAD=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita suporte "
"ao gamepad. Remova essa chave se você tiver <ulink "
"url=\"https://gnome.pages.gitlab.gnome.org/libmanette/\">libmanette</ulink> "
"instalado e desejar habilitá-lo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:351
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_MINIBROWSER=ON</parameter>: This switch enables "
"compiling and installing the MiniBrowser."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_MINIBROWSER=ON</parameter>: Essa chave habilita "
"compilar e instalar o MiniBrowser."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:356
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_WEBDRIVER=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables "
"compiling and installing <command>WebKitWebDriver</command>.  We use it for "
"the GTK-3 build because the <command>WebKitWebDriver</command> from the "
"GTK-3 build will be overwritten by the GTK-4 build anyway.  Remove this "
"option if you don't plan to build this package with GTK-4."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_WEBDRIVER=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"compilar e instalar <command>WebKitWebDriver</command>. Nós a usamos para a "
"construção do GTK-3 porque o <command>WebKitWebDriver</command> proveniente "
"da construção do GTK-3 será sobrescrito pela construção do GTK-4 de qualquer"
" maneira. Remova essa opção se você não planeja construir esse pacote com "
"GTK-4."

#.  Note: This works well on both i686 and x86_64. -renodr
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:365
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_BUBBLEWRAP_SANDBOX=ON</parameter>: This switch enables "
"the Bubblewrap sandbox, which helps mitigate the impact of most security "
"vulnerabilities in this package. Change this switch to OFF if you do not "
"want to install <xref linkend=\"bubblewrap\" role=\"nodep\"/>, <xref "
"linkend='libseccomp' role=\"nodep\"/>, or <xref linkend=\"xdg-dbus-proxy\" "
"role=\"nodep\"/>, but note that this may put you at risk."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_BUBBLEWRAP_SANDBOX=ON</parameter>: Essa chave habilita "
"o sandbox Bubblewrap, que ajuda a mitigar o impacto da maioria das "
"vulnerabilidades de segurança nesse pacote. Mude essa chave para OFF se você"
" não quiser instalar <xref linkend=\"bubblewrap\" role=\"nodep\"/>, <xref "
"linkend='libseccomp' role=\"nodep\"/> ou <xref linkend=\"xdg-dbus-proxy\" "
"role=\"nodep\"/>, mas observe que isso possivelmente te coloque em risco."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:376
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_JOURNALD_LOG=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables "
"using the systemd journal for logging errors and debugging information since"
" it is not available on SysV systems."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_JOURNALD_LOG=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita "
"usar o diário do systemd para registrar erros e informações de depuração, "
"uma vez que ele não está disponível em sistemas SysV."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:382
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D USE_SYSPROF_CAPTURE=NO</parameter>: This switch disables a "
"hard dependency on <ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D USE_SYSPROF_CAPTURE=NO</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita uma "
"dependência rígida de <ulink url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:387
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_SPEECH_SYNTHESIS=OFF</parameter>: This switch disables "
"building speech synthesis support into WebKitGTK because it requires "
"additional external dependencies. You will need both <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.festvox.org/flite/\">flite</ulink> and <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/project-spiel/libspiel\">libspiel</ulink> if you "
"wish to enable this."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D ENABLE_SPEECH_SYNTHESIS=OFF</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita"
" construir suporte à síntese de fala no WebKitGTK porque ele exige "
"dependências externas adicionais. Você precisará de <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.festvox.org/flite/\">flite</ulink> e <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/project-spiel/libspiel\">libspiel</ulink> se "
"desejar habilitar isso."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:396
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D USE_SYSTEM_MALLOC=ON</option>: This switch enables building "
"against the system installed <application>malloc</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D USE_SYSTEM_MALLOC=ON</option>: Essa chave habilita construir "
"contra o <application>malloc</application> instalado no sistema."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:401
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_GEOLOCATION=OFF</option>: Use this switch if you don't "
"want to install <xref linkend=\"geoclue2\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D ENABLE_GEOLOCATION=OFF</option>: Use essa chave se você não "
"quiser instalar o <xref linkend=\"geoclue2\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:406
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D USE_AVIF=OFF</option>: Use this switch if you don't want to "
"install <xref linkend=\"libavif\"/>. Note that you will not have support for"
" AVIF images if you do this."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D USE_AVIF=OFF</option>: Use essa chave se você não quiser instalar"
" <xref linkend=\"libavif\"/>. Observe que você não terá suporte para imagens"
" AVIF se fizer isso."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:412
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D USE_WOFF2=ON</option>: Use this switch if the optional package "
"<xref linkend=\"woff2\"/> is installed. This adds additional support for "
"fonts."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D USE_WOFF2=ON</option>: Use essa chave se o pacote opcional <xref "
"linkend=\"woff2\"/> estiver instalado. Isso adiciona suporte adicional para "
"fontes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/webkitgtk.xml:418
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D USE_JPEGXL=OFF</option>: Use this switch if the recommended "
"package <xref linkend=\"libjxl\"/> is not installed. Note that you will not "
"have support for JPEG XL images if this option is passed."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D USE_JPEGXL=OFF</option>: Use essa chave se o pacote recomendado "
"<xref linkend=\"libjxl\"/> não estiver instalado. Observe que você não terá "
"suporte para imagens JPEG XL se essa opção for passada."

